# The sudo prompt at 320x480 (profile p320; study portrait-320, PR-B), over native Settings, with the on-screen keyboard
# (no physical keyboard): open, typed (masked), a wrong password. Golden at 320x480 only.
title p320 dialog
sizes 320x480
profile p320
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env APPLAUNCH_OSK auto
keyboards 0
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
launch Settings
sudoprompt open
shot p320_sudo_open
type secret
shot p320_sudo_typed
sudoprompt wrong
shot p320_sudo_wrong
